            },
            "reviewBody": "This was my first time making ricotta cookies and this recipe was simple, moist and delicious. The only change that I made was to use fresh orange juice in place of milk for the icing, since I did not have milk on hand. Will definitely be making these again!",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-16T17:48:31.650Z"
